# BrayDashy Software Only Filter

# Directories to exclude from GitHub repo
Marketing/
Management/*
!Management/Docs/
Management/Docs/*
!Management/Docs/CHANGELOG.md

# Local runtime configuration & personal profiles (Never commit personal IPs, names, or API keys)
Software/Data/config.json
Software/Data/*.bak
Software/Data/profiles/
Software/Server/data/

# Standard JS/Vite Exclusions
node_modules/
dist/
.tmp/
*.tsbuildinfo

# OS Exclusions
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Release bundles built by Software/Deployment/release.mjs (published to Forgejo releases)
.release/
